adratic formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }_{2,3} & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{(4)^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 29}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{-100}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm 10\\text{i}}{2} \\\\  & =-2\\pm 5\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the block diagonal matrix is\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562405 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09b68aea-97d5-51b6-9132-7df35f600448" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561612} {:answer/id #uuid "47b27817-bd80-505f-b07b-c3c158425c85" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561762} {:answer/id #uuid "91275c69-8063-5cb2-b49c-515df48585f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561944} {:answer/id #uuid "cf53e7fc-c0b1-596c-b202-7fc49f68a694" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562099} {:answer/id #uuid "f8908321-ea0c-5285-b60a-63e814cafb5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562196}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561944} :answer-field/id #uuid "0adbc0e4-187e-56fd-8b95-21d149ac375f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562227}] :question/id #uuid "1b4b44b9-ba7c-5f44-b9ab-fefd