{v}_{3}) \\\\ | & | & | & |\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSwapping the blocks on the main diagonal of $B$ will result in switching the corresponding columns in $P.$\n\nFrom our block diagonal matrix\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nwe deduce that the first and second columns of $P$ correspond to the complex eigenvector ${v}_{1},$ and the third and forth columns of $P$ correspond to the complex eigenvector ${v}_{3}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -2 & 4 & -7 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326731 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3bec3827-231c-556a-a0b7-54f8d9348b15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324456} {:answer/id #uuid "4b4f90f2-dfb3-5853-86f9-c1ac39d8f5e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324583} {:answer/id #uuid "7a139465-9f74-545d-896e-f96a9b5d526b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324991} {:answer/id #uuid "7d7de5fe-c21c-5372-8be7-65c7a015e53a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325029} {:answer/id #uuid "c5ecf648-b192-5e75-aed6-35c76e8b200a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325678}] :answer-field/correct {:answe