nal of $B$ will result in switching the corresponding columns in $P.$\n\n- From our block diagonal matrix \n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 7 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nwe deduce the complex eigenvalues are ${\\lambda }_{2,3}=5\\pm 7\\text{i}$ and the real eigenvalue is ${\\lambda }_{1}=-1.$\n\n- From our matrix \n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 6 \\\\ -3 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nwe deduce that the complex and real eigenvectors are\n\n$$\n{v}_{2,3}=\\begin{bmatrix}4\\pm 6\\text{i} \\\\ ∓2\\text{i} \\\\ 5\\pm 3\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix},\\,{v}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269069 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11504871-6e11-558c-a4a9-c918ea05ff9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =8\\pm 5\\text{i}$ and $v=\\begin{bmatrix}5\\pm \\text{i} \\\\ ∓7\\text{i} \\\\ 5∓3\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266288} {:answer/id #uuid "1797afb6-8aac-566a-b295-c8e35e784155" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =3\\pm 8\\text{i}$ and $v=\\begin{bmatrix}1∓4\\text{i} \\\\ ∓7\\text{i} \\\\ 3\\pm 5\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266339} {:answer/id #uuid "87106873-8a44-5d40-96ea-a6501b636344" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =5\\pm 3\\text{i}$ and $v=\\begin{bmatrix}-1\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ ∓7\\text{i} \\\\ 5\\pm 3\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267337} {:answer/id #uuid "c7b283eb-f9f6-57ab-94e6-2c5847ed233b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =8\\pm 3\\text{i}$ and $v=\\begin{bmatrix}1\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ ∓7\\text{i} \\\\ 5\\pm 3\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267935} {:answer/id #uuid "fc97233b-eafb-51b3-ba25-8ec19eca0bf9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-8\\pm 3\\text{i}$ and $v=\\begin{bmatrix}1\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ \