he entries on the main diagonal are the same, while the antidiagonal entries have opposite signs.\n\nWith that in mind let's check each of the given matrices:\n\n- $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 4 \\\\ -4 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$ is a rotation-scaling matrix.\n\n- $B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 3\\end{bmatrix}$ is a rotation-scaling matrix.\n\n- $C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ is a rotation-scaling matrix.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326753 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "730a249f-9909-593e-987f-dcb1e3654985" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467446} {:answer/id #uuid "7f562f29-d90e-52f9-a7c0-0ade3faa4c2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467447}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467446} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f4fa1a9-caa6-575d-a4db-3f3150f93271" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468444} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d273d575-ee96-58bd-a8a5-dcc0d66f8b53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467448} {:answer/id #uuid "a962ee5c-cb7e-5e12-a832-bf6811118ac3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467449}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467448} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5648ff4-d2eb-5a4c-8bce-106d5afbf1de" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468445} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76543da4-6b12-564a-8961-72a8de60a798" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467450} {:an